# Directories whose payload scripts/prune.sh deletes after fetching. Only
# test data a release build never reads. Files GN reads (BUILD.gn, *.gni,
# *.pydeps) are kept; tools/perf is not pruned because the root BUILD.gn
# reads its .pydeps.
third_party/blink/web_tests
third_party/blink/perf_tests
chrome/test/data
content/test/data
components/test/data
media/test/data
net/data
